  "details": "I was using K2EX (KinectToVR), the despawn button functions the same as turning off physical Vive trackers, where the device stays in the list on the SteamVR window but stops existing in VR.\n\nI launched the game with trackers on, calibrated, then clicked Disable FBT, and turned off trackers.\n\nThe avatar reloaded and the menu became this.\n\nTurning the trackers on again made the menu go back to normal.",
